# Design system (Stonecaster)

Start at `docs/design/README.md`. Full rules: `.agent/rules/rule-design-system.md` and `.agent/rules/rule-play-screen-design.md`. Shared agent guide: `AGENTS.md`.

- Mobile first: 390x844, then 1100 and 1440. Match `docs/design/screens/*-Mobile.png` before desktop.
- Tokens only (`docs/design/play-redesign/tokens.css`). No raw hex/rgb or Tailwind palette classes in new or changed code. Run `node scripts/check-design-tokens.mjs`.
- Text ≥ 12px, targets ≥ 44px, labelled icon buttons, visible focus, reduced motion respected.
- Play screen: `SPEC.md` §11 overrides older boards. Panels open/slim/hidden, focus mode, modules shown only when the story's rulesets declare them, no invented Health.
- Current task: `docs/design/play-redesign/PHASE0_BRIEF.md`.

